style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;">If you purchase Fund Shares through a broker-dealer or other financial intermediary (such as a bank), the Adviser&nbsp;or its affiliates </font><font
style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;">may pay the financial intermediary for certain activities related to the Fund, including educational training programs, conferences, </font><font
style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;">the development of technology platforms and reporting systems, or other services related to the sale or promotion of the Fund.
</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;">These payments may create a conflict of interest by influencing the broker-dealer or other intermediary and your salesperson to </font><font
style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;">recommend the Fund over another investment. Ask your salesperson or visit your financial intermediary's website for more
</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;">information.</font></div> </div> <div style="line-height:1.0pt;text-align:left;"> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both;"> </div>
